Couple questions for other ascenders:

***possible spoilers***























Is there an easier way of finding the magic portal on the water plane,
other than just floating around? It was fun though, brilliantly done,
but the Wizard popped up MANY times. Most annoying. When he first stole
the Amulet I had this horrible feeling after I killed him that it was
gone forever... Very well done indeed.

Also, why did the Dev Team allow teleport on the Astral plane??? I didn't
fight a single creature (I was tempted though!) -- just teleported straight
to my altar (got lucky on the choice). Surely teleport shouldn't be allowed
there. I just got a glimpse of Pestilence, then ascended. Are these guys
tough?

For the record: Archeolgist 585 HP, AC -35, 6.9 million points. Unused
charges on a WoW, and an unused magic lamp (handy light sources those!).
Chewed up MANY wands of teleport, digging, and death though.

All in all, very enjoyable. I've got a Priestess at the Wizard's stronghold,
and I'm looking forward to starting a Samurai soon...

